WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.170
Your name, your photo, your theme. This is your account.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.384
Tap your avatar on My Popkins, and Your account opens.

00:00:11.584 --> 00:00:16.331
It shows your photo, your name, and the phone number you sign in with. That number

00:00:16.331 --> 00:00:19.352
is read-only, and never shown to other members.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.507
Change your name or your photo, and choose Save changes.

00:00:27.707 --> 00:00:32.296
A message says it was saved just now, and the new name shows wherever you appear.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.823
Leave the name empty, and nothing is saved. The field says: enter a name so people

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:42.123
know who you are.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.199
Pick a theme: Match my device, Light or Dark. Popkin takes it at once, and remembers

00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:52.613
it on this device.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.179
Sign out asks first. Stay signed in is where the focus starts.

00:01:00.379 --> 00:01:04.935
Confirm, and the session ends on this device. The welcome screen opens.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.656
On a phone or a desktop, the account keeps one readable column in the middle.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.062
What no screen shows: a signed out session stops working at once, wherever a copy of

00:01:23.062 --> 00:01:23.724
it is.

00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:27.468
Still to come: telling the others live when a name changes.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.992
That is journey seventeen. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
